IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g3-nouns`
IMPORT `g3-art8-register`
IMPORT `g3-fixtures`

-- g3-tests-art8-historic.l4: tests of Article 8(5), the five items entered in the historic section for a formerly registered charity that has been deregistered (src:243-248).
-- Expected values are decided from the text: (a) the former number, (b) names only "if the entity was registered in the general section", (c) the summary of the reason,
-- (d) the two dates, (e) other matters prescribed by Order.

§ `Tests of Article 8(5): the historic section`

fav MEANS `the favoured interpretation of Articles 8 to 10`

`entry (a)` MEANS `the entity's former registered number`
`entry (b)` MEANS `the name under which the entity was registered immediately before deregistration, and the names under which it was previously so registered`
`entry (c)` MEANS `a summary of the reason why the entity was deregistered`
`entry (d)` MEANS `the dates on which the entity was registered and deregistered`
`entry (e)` MEANS `such other matters as the Minister prescribes by Order`

GIVEN ps IS A LIST OF `Placement of an entity in a section of the register`
      names IS A LIST OF STRING
      matters IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A `Facts for the items of Article 8(5)`
`historic facts: placements` ps `, previous names` names `, matters prescribed by Order` matters MEANS
    `Facts for the items of Article 8(5)` WITH
        `placements of the entity before deregistration` IS ps
        `previous registered names` IS names
        `matters prescribed by an Order under Article 8(5)(e)` IS matters

`only the general section` MEANS LIST (`a placement in` `the general section` `on` (YMD 2019 3 1))
`only the restricted section` MEANS LIST (`a placement in` `the restricted section` `on` (YMD 2019 3 1))
`the general section and then the restricted section` MEANS LIST (`a placement in` `the general section` `on` (YMD 2019 3 1)), (`a placement in` `the restricted section` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1))
`the restricted section and then the general section` MEANS LIST (`a placement in` `the restricted section` `on` (YMD 2019 3 1)), (`a placement in` `the general section` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1))

§§ `Which items are required`

-- Registered in the general section: all of (a) to (d); (e) only if an Order prescribes other matters.
#ASSERT `Art 8(5) the entries required in the historic section` fav `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019 and deregistered on 1 June 2024` (`historic facts: placements` `only the general section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY) EQUALS LIST `entry (a)`, `entry (b)`, `entry (c)`, `entry (d)`
#ASSERT `Art 8(5) the entries required in the historic section` fav `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019 and deregistered on 1 June 2024` (`historic facts: placements` `only the general section` `, previous names` (LIST "Alpha Aid") `, matters prescribed by Order` (LIST "the date of the last annual return")) EQUALS LIST `entry (a)`, `entry (b)`, `entry (c)`, `entry (d)`, `entry (e)`
-- Registered in the restricted section: the name is not entered, so (b) is not required.
#ASSERT `Art 8(5) the entries required in the historic section` fav `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019 and deregistered on 1 June 2024` (`historic facts: placements` `only the restricted section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY) EQUALS LIST `entry (a)`, `entry (c)`, `entry (d)`
#ASSERT `Art 8(5) the entries required in the historic section` fav `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019 and deregistered on 1 June 2024` (`historic facts: placements` `only the restricted section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` (LIST "the date of the last annual return")) EQUALS LIST `entry (a)`, `entry (c)`, `entry (d)`, `entry (e)`
-- An entity that is not in the historic section has no historic-section item: the registered, the applicant, the never-registered.
#ASSERT `Art 8(5) the entries required in the historic section` fav `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019` (`historic facts: placements` `only the general section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` (LIST "x")) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `Art 8(5) the entries required in the historic section` fav (`the register record of` `a company that applies` `registered on` (YMD 2019 3 1) `and deregistered on` NOTHING) (`historic facts: placements` EMPTY `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY) EQUALS EMPTY

§§ `F3.11: general section, then restricted, then deregistered (and the reverse)`

-- Favoured reading: the section immediately before deregistration decides.  General then restricted: restricted, so the name is not entered.
#ASSERT `Art 8(5)(b) the entity was registered in the general section` fav (`historic facts: placements` `the general section and then the restricted section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY) EQUALS FALSE
-- Other reading: any time in the general section counts.
#ASSERT `Art 8(5)(b) the entity was registered in the general section` `interpretation F3.11 reading B` (`historic facts: placements` `the general section and then the restricted section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY)
-- Restricted then general: general immediately before deregistration, on either reading.
#ASSERT `Art 8(5)(b) the entity was registered in the general section` fav (`historic facts: placements` `the restricted section and then the general section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY)
#ASSERT `Art 8(5)(b) the entity was registered in the general section` `interpretation F3.11 reading B` (`historic facts: placements` `the restricted section and then the general section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY)
-- General only and restricted only: the same on both readings.
#ASSERT `Art 8(5)(b) the entity was registered in the general section` fav (`historic facts: placements` `only the general section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY)
#ASSERT `Art 8(5)(b) the entity was registered in the general section` `interpretation F3.11 reading B` (`historic facts: placements` `only the general section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY)
#ASSERT NOT `Art 8(5)(b) the entity was registered in the general section` fav (`historic facts: placements` `only the restricted section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY)
#ASSERT NOT `Art 8(5)(b) the entity was registered in the general section` `interpretation F3.11 reading B` (`historic facts: placements` `only the restricted section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY)
-- The list of required items follows the reading.
#ASSERT `Art 8(5) the entries required in the historic section` `interpretation F3.11 reading B` `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019 and deregistered on 1 June 2024` (`historic facts: placements` `the general section and then the restricted section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY) EQUALS LIST `entry (a)`, `entry (b)`, `entry (c)`, `entry (d)`
-- Without any recorded entry the Law gives no answer, and a missing fact is not "no": the question is refused.
#ASSERT REFUSED `Art 8(5)(b) the entity was registered in the general section` fav (`historic facts: placements` EMPTY `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Art 8(5)(b) the entity was registered in the general section` `interpretation F3.11 reading B` (`historic facts: placements` EMPTY `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY)

§§ `The names to be entered`

-- The name immediately before deregistration, then "any names under which it was previously so registered".
#ASSERT `Art 8(5)(b) the names to be entered in the historic section` fav `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019 and deregistered on 1 June 2024` (`historic facts: placements` `only the general section` `, previous names` (LIST "Alpha Aid", "Alpha Relief") `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY) EQUALS LIST "Alpha Charity Limited", "Alpha Aid", "Alpha Relief"
#ASSERT `Art 8(5)(b) the names to be entered in the historic section` fav `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019 and deregistered on 1 June 2024` (`historic facts: placements` `only the general section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY) EQUALS LIST "Alpha Charity Limited"
-- A charity that was in the restricted section: no name is entered.
#ASSERT `Art 8(5)(b) the names to be entered in the historic section` fav `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019 and deregistered on 1 June 2024` (`historic facts: placements` `only the restricted section` `, previous names` (LIST "Alpha Aid") `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY) EQUALS EMPTY

§§ `Article 8(5)(c): the reason for the service of the notice`

-- "including, if that reason was a contravention of a required steps notice, the reason for the service of that notice": only the failure to comply with such a notice.
#ASSERT `Art 8(5)(c) the summary must include the reason for the service of the notice` `the entity has failed to comply with a required steps notice`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 8(5)(c) the summary must include the reason for the service of the notice` `on the entity's own application under Article 15`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 8(5)(c) the summary must include the reason for the service of the notice` `the entity no longer meets the charity test`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 8(5)(c) the summary must include the reason for the service of the notice` `the Commissioner was misled into registering the entity`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 8(5)(c) the summary must include the reason for the service of the notice` `a circumstance prescribed by Order under Article 16(1)(d)`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 8(5)(c) the summary must include the reason for the service of the notice` `the entity no longer exists`

§§ `The duty: the Commissioner must enter each item`

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 8(5) the Commissioner must enter in the historic section the entries required for the formerly registered charity` fav `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019 and deregistered on 1 June 2024` (`historic facts: placements` `only the general section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `enter in the historic section an item required in respect of a formerly registered charity` `entry (d)` AT 1
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `enter in the historic section an item required in respect of a formerly registered charity` `entry (a)` AT 2
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `enter in the historic section an item required in respect of a formerly registered charity` `entry (c)` AT 3
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `enter in the historic section an item required in respect of a formerly registered charity` `entry (b)` AT 4

-- Only three of the four: the duty stands.
-- EXPECT: STANDING | MUST `enter in the historic section an item required in respect of a formerly registered charity`
#TRACE `Art 8(5) the Commissioner must enter in the historic section the entries required for the formerly registered charity` fav `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019 and deregistered on 1 June 2024` (`historic facts: placements` `only the general section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `enter in the historic section an item required in respect of a formerly registered charity` `entry (a)` AT 2
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `enter in the historic section an item required in respect of a formerly registered charity` `entry (c)` AT 3
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `enter in the historic section an item required in respect of a formerly registered charity` `entry (d)` AT 4

-- A charity that was in the restricted section: three items, none of them the name.
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 8(5) the Commissioner must enter in the historic section the entries required for the formerly registered charity` fav `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019 and deregistered on 1 June 2024` (`historic facts: placements` `only the restricted section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `enter in the historic section an item required in respect of a formerly registered charity` `entry (a)` AT 1
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `enter in the historic section an item required in respect of a formerly registered charity` `entry (c)` AT 2
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `enter in the historic section an item required in respect of a formerly registered charity` `entry (d)` AT 3

-- Not in the historic section: nothing to enter.
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 8(5) the Commissioner must enter in the historic section the entries required for the formerly registered charity` fav `Alpha, registered on 1 March 2019` (`historic facts: placements` `only the general section` `, previous names` EMPTY `, matters prescribed by Order` EMPTY) AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 5)
